part cis_2025
  tally 2
  note "Bank Cis current account LN45 2090 0017 5521 3380 0001, 2025: every row of the twelve exports, as observations (L §5.19). Each export is a CSV with # header lines and dd-mm-yyyy dates, which no Tally text loads (O:B-1), so the rows are written out, each citing its file and line; the importer would need the dialect and the matching rules (O:B-1)."
  note "One version per export, covering its month, known on the 2nd of the next month (the story: each month exported in the first days of the next month; the day is assumed). The November export's rows stop on 2025-11-13, so its version covers 2025-11-01 .. 2025-11-13 only. Readings: the export's opening balance at the start of its first day, and the balance after the last row of each day at that day's end (anchored)."

